\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \lang1040 1. The God of love, to earth He came,
\par That you might come to heaven;
\par Believe, believe in Jesu's name,
\par And all your sin's forgiven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Believe in Him that died for thee,
\par And, sure as He has died,
\par Thy debt is paid, thy soul is free,
\par And thou art justified.
\par \lang1033 
\par \f1 
